{
 "name": "Progressive ring size on Brain Engine 26: perplexity/KLD of 8+3 and 8+4 with the sharp ring at a quarter of 4,096 (1,024) and half (2,048) at 16K x 2, beside the full ring and plain q3_0/q4_0",
